ent-OreBag = 礦石袋 | ore bag
    .desc = 一款堅固耐用的背包，專為回收專家與礦工設計，用於搬運大量礦石。當繫在腰帶上時，會使附近的礦石磁化。 | A robust bag for salvage specialists and miners alike to carry large amounts of ore. Magnetises any nearby ores when attached to a belt.
ent-BorgOreBag = 一體式礦石袋 | integrated ore bag
    .desc = 一個嵌入採礦賽博格框架的大型礦石袋。拿在手中時，會使附近的礦石磁化。 | A large ore bag built into the frame of a mining cyborg. Magnetises any nearby ores when held.
